śrīkāmike ca (-) 

īśānavaktrā dūrdhvasthāt jñānaṃ yatkāryatvādikam | 
ṛgyajussāmātharvaśca puruṣādyānanodbhavāḥ | 

tathaiva mantra tantrākhyaṃ sadāśiva mukhodgatam | siddhāntaṃ 
gāruḍhaṃ vāmaṃ bhūtatantrañca bhairavam | 

