tatassarvāṇi śāstrāṇi svasvāvadhi pramāṇānyeva | tathā 
sādhitaṃśrīrāmakaṇṭha śivācāryeṇa raurave vṛttiviveke 
taduktañca pauṣkare (-) 

anyopi mārgo vedādiḥ paśupāśārthadarśakaḥ | svokta tatvāvadhi 
