ṣaṭsahasrikāyām (-) 

<p. 1252> 

śṛṇu ṣaṇmukha tatvena bhogamokṣau yathā sthitau | 
brahmacārīgṛhasthaśca dvividho deśikottamaḥ | 

dīkṣā pratiṣṭhayoretau ubhāvapyadhikāriṇau | kintu mokṣaika 
