vyākhyānaṃ cintanaṃ bhavet | 

sadācāryābhiṣekeṇa yukto vidvat samāraṇyakaḥ | yatīnāṃ 
trividhaṃ proktaṃ śaivānāñcaturāśrame | 

āśūdrāṇāñca bhedosti niṣṭhā bhedo na vidyate | (*)rkadvayaṃ 
