brāhmaṇādi caturvarṇāḥ kāśyapādi samudbhavāḥ | parameśa 
prasādena adhikāre niyojitāḥ | 

śecarā gotrasūtrañca saṃkṣepeṇa vadāmyaham | gocaraṃ 
śivacihnaṃ hi gotra sma munivargakam | 

<p. 1255> 

sūtramācāramevaṃ hi śaivānāmucyate kramāt | śiśśikhā tathā 
